=\frac{x-1}{\sqrt{x+3}+2}\cdot\frac{\sqrt{x}+1}{x-1}
=\frac{\sqrt{x}+1}{\sqrt{x+3}+2}\]令\(x\to1\)，得到\[\lim_{x\to1}\frac{\sqrt{x+3}-2}{\sqrt{x}-1}=\frac{2}{4}=\frac12\]故选 A.

由递推式逐项相加，得到\[a_n=a_1+\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\ln\left(1+\frac1k\right)
=2+\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\ln\frac{k+1}{k}\]利用对数的运算性质，\[\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\ln\frac{k+1}{k}
